nts against them served. We’ll keep you updated as the story progresses. Join The Resistance And Share This Article Now! 2.2k SHARES SHARE ON FACEBOOK SHARE ON TWITTER About Stryker 218 Articles Stryker is a constitutional conservative who can't stand the lazy, crybaby , fantasy world liberals live in. Knowledge is power. The truth will set you free. May the good Lord bless and keep the United States of America. Previous article Search for: Join The Resistance On Facebook ABOUT THE RESISTANCE: We are a group of educated, God-fearing Christian conservative patriots who are tired of Obama’s tyrannical reign and ready to see a strong Republican take the White House. We are sovereign citizens who want our government to keep its nose out of our business. We believe in guns, God and the Constitution and will go to any lengths to take OUR country back from the whiny, politically correct liberal masses. JOIN US ON FACEBOOK: Meet Our Authors Stryker published 218 articles Vixen published 10 articles Patriot published 9 articles Freedom published 7 articles Recent Comments C. KING on WHOA! Hillary Caught On Hot Mic Trashing Beyonce’ With RACIAL SLURS! C. KING on WHOA! Hillary Caught On Hot Mic Trashing Beyonce’ With RACIAL SLURS! K. Freed on WHOA! Hillary Caught On Hot Mic Trashing Beyonce’ With RACIAL SLURS! Copyright © 2016 | The Resistance: Twisted News For Conservative Minds | All Rights Reserved",1,Politifact,test
