hat must never be touched by future presidents. William Howard Taft left his giant bathtub. Bill Clinton left one of his saxophones. George W. Bush left a piece of mirror and a rolled up hundred. | Tweet | Like 0 Comments comments Posted in Politics Tagged Obama , statue ← Uber Driver Refuses To Pick Up Woman In Labor, Didn’t Want To Help Deliver Baby Russia Is Probably Hacking Your Computer Right Now – What You Can Do To Stop Them! → About / Disclaimer Privacy Policy Terms and conditions Feed Copyright © 2026 Empire News LLC Design & Developed By Open Source Technologies.",1,Politifact,train
