would not have had hotel rooms if Hillary Clinton had become president. It was already too late by Election Day.” “But I bet even if Hillary had to sleep in a youth hostel,” he went on, “no one in the press would say it was her staffs’ fault.” That is the double standard that we have to live with as Americans and it will not get any better. What do you think about this whole mess? (h/t Young Conservatives ) 62.1k SHARES Share Previous article Ivanka And Jared Seen As G20 Summit Next article First Lady Melania Expressed Support For Hamburg Victims B. D. -Advertisement- RELATED ARTICLES MORE FROM AUTHOR Politics Obama Caught Coming Back To American Politics Politics IRS Loses Lerner Emails Politics The White House Exposes John McCain’s Backyard RECENT POSTS Democrat Arrested On Child Pornography News B. D. - July 20, 2017 0 John McCain Gets Showered With Support News B. D. - July 20, 2017 0 ICE Is Ready To Put Sanctuary Cities Under Control News R. M. - July 20, 2017 0 23 Republicans Support Transgender Surgeries News R. M. - July 20, 2017 0 Breaking: Meghan McCain Releases Moving Statement on Her Father’s Diagnosis News worldpoliticus - July 20, 2017 0 -Advertisement- Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions Disclaimer Policy Contact © 2017 www.world-politicus.com Edit with Live CSS Save Write CSS OR LESS and hit save. CTRL + SPACE for auto-complete.",1,Politifact,train
