n reality TV under one condition"",url:""https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxnews.com\u002Fvideo\u002F6406369217112"",imageUrl:""https:\u002F\u002Fcf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net\u002Fv1\u002Fstatic\u002F694940094001\u002Fac746761-e2c8-41b7-8876-a73e5845fd44\u002Ff8ddfc1f-8147-4da7-b6b7-2928bed25ca5\u002F1280x720\u002Fmatch\u002Fimage.jpg"",""data-duration"":""1:03""},{contentId:""ca7a4861-0268-5c67-be20-6760f9c8dd16"",title:""Trump ramps up midterm fight as election looms"",url:""https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxnews.com\u002Fvideo\u002F6406366945112"",imageUrl:""https:\u002F\u002Fcf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net\u002Fv1\u002Fstatic\u002F694940094001\u002F70546b0c-bed0-4e8f-8a4d-62e4e7ceb456\u002Fc05c5428-5259-4712-996b-43ac2c95be5a\u002F1280x720\u002Fmatch\u002Fimage.jpg"",""data-duration"":""10:58""},{contentId:""796de7ae-9193-533a-aef1-7c97777f6b9a"",title:""Trump approves firing squad execution for Fort Hood terrorist"",url:""https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxnews.com\u002Fvideo\u002F6406366740112"",imageUrl:""https:\u002F\u002Fcf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net\u002Fv1\u002Fstatic\u002F694940094001\u002F6f54b7b2-8e81-4e42-a57e-43747161542d\u002Fea8c71c0-a714-4260-9985-9e2082516b68\u002F1280x720\u002Fmatch\u002Fimage.jpg"",""data-duration"":""10:54""},{contentId:""bdf032b2-87d1-5244-a6a4-7b79b87e6210"",title:""Top War Dept official sounds alarm on foreign influence in anti-data center movement"",url:""https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxnews.com\u002Fvideo\u002F6406366026112"",imageUrl:""https:\u002F\u002Fcf-images.us-east-1.prod.boltdns.net\u002Fv1\u002Fstatic\u002F694940094001\u002Fabbc3a28-e8eb-43af-8478-b2672aa92e99\u002F30f1a84a-a08c-495d-b01f-5f797a3937bc\u002F1280x720\u002Fmatch\u002Fimage.jpg"",""data-duration"":""3:57""},{contentId:""aa138214-874d-593b-9e82-0ddfefca0a02"",title:""Fox Nation explores Rudy Giuliani’s Mafia Commission Trial, Donnie Brasco’s double life in hit series"",url:""https:\u002F\u002Fwww.foxnews.com\u002Fvideo\u002F6406366004112"",imageUrl:""https:\u002F\u00