Politifact:politifact15355,"Black Men Arrested In Philadelphia Starbucks Settle For $2 | The Rickey Smiley Morning Show 14 captures 03 May 2018 - 10 Jun 2024 Apr MAY Jun 03 2017 2018 2019 success fail About this capture TIMESTAMPS The Wayback Machine - https://web.archive.org/web/20180503143610/https://rickeysmileymorningshow.com/1908839/black-men-arrested-in-philadelphia-starbucks-settle-for-2-million/ Close menu Home The Show 3 Things You Should Know Bernice Jenkins Black Tony Church Announcements Contact Us Dish Nation Dumb Ass News Flow & Go Front Page Gary’s Tea Hip-Hop Spot Hip-Hop Translation Interviews Joke Of The Day Juicy’s Song Of The Week News You Can’t Use Newsletter Paternity Test Tuesdays Sign Up Photos Poems/Spoken Word Praise Break Techie Tuesdays Text Club Top 5 Videos Events Cast Rickey Smiley Da Brat Gary With Da Tea Headkrack Juicy Special K Rock-T JahLion Sound Black Tony Jeff Johnson Dr. Collier Psychic Wayne Photos Of The Cast Videos Of The Cast Contests Photos Photos Of The Cast Latest Photos Videos Cast Videos Dish Nation Latest Stations About Us Contact Us Privacy Terms Of Service Advertising EEO Careers FAQ R1 Digital Facebook Twitter Copyright © 2018 Interactive One, LLC . All Rights Reserved Powered by WordPress.com VIP Home The Show 3 Things You Should Know Bernice Jenkins Black Tony Church Announcements Contact Us Dish Nation Dumb Ass News Flow & Go Front Page Gary’s Tea Hip-Hop Spot Hip-Hop Translation Interviews Joke Of The Day Juicy’s Song Of The Week News You Can’t Use Newsletter Paternity Test Tuesdays Sign Up Photos Poems/Spoken Word Praise Break Techie Tuesdays Text Club Top 5 Videos Events Cast Rickey Smiley Da Brat Gary With Da Tea Headkrack Juicy Special K Rock-T JahLion Sound Black Tony Jeff Johnson Dr. Collier Psychic Wayne Photos Of The Cast Videos Of The Cast Contests Photos Photos Of The Cast Latest Photos Videos Cast Videos Dish Nation Latest Stations Entertainment News Home > Entertainment News Black Men Arrested In Philadelphia Starbucks Settle For $2 Million However, the pair will help direct a new $200,000 grant program designed to help young business owners like themselves. Rickey Smiley Morning Show Posted 17 hours ago 2.53K reads Leave a comment Source: Lorenzo Bevilaqua / Getty Instead of a long and drawn-out legal battle, the men at the center of the Philadelphia Starbucks arrest incident have taken an incredibly low settlement from the city with a perk that speaks to their interests. Taking $1 dollar settlements each, Rashon Nelson and Donte Robinson will help spearhead a $200,000 grant program designed to aid young entrepreneurs like themselves. NBC News reports : The two black men whose arrest at a Philadelphia Starbucks last month set off a wave of protests against the coffee giant for discrimination have reached a settlement with the city, the mayor’s office said Wednesday. They will each be paid $1. In addition, Donte Robinson and Rashon Nelson, both 23, will release the city and employees of all claims in exchange for the creation of a $200,000 fund that, through the help of a nonprofit organization, will assist young entrepreneurs in Philadelphia. Robinson and Nelson will also serve on a committee to establish and award the grants, which will focus on starting a pilot curriculum for public high school students to attain the skills to become business owners. Good for Nelson, Robinson, and the city of Philadelphia in turning this into a positive moment. — Photo: Getty Related Starbucks Also On The Rickey Smiley Morning Show: Xscape On The Rickey Smiley Morning Show xscape,the rickey smiley morning show "" data-medium-file=""https://web.archive.org/web/20180503143610/https://ronerickeysmileymorningshow.files.wordpress.com/2018/02/1518094392872.jpg?quality=80&strip=all&w=300"" data-large-file=""https://web.archive.org/web/20180503143610/https://ronerickeysmileymorningshow.files.wordpress.com/2018/02/1518094392872.jpg?quality=80&strip=all&w=1024"" data-lazy-src=""http