Politifact:politifact15501,"TRUMP APPROVAL RATING Better than Obama and Reagan at Same Point in their Presidencies * The Gateway Pundit * by Jim Hoft Skip to content Menu Get Ad Free Gateway Hispanic RINO Watch TGP Videos Store Please Donate to TGP Tip Line Log In / Register Log In / Register Register Manage Account Cancel Account Menu Home About Us About Us Advertise On The Gateway Pundit Privacy Terms Stats Store Join Us Log In Subscribe to our newsletter Become a Member Visit the TGP Store Contact Us Comment Support Membership Support Donation Support Send News Tips to The Gateway Pundit Technical Support Media Inquiries Newsletter Support Been Censored By Big Tech? Advertise On The Gateway Pundit How To Help How To Help Support TGP With a Donation Store English English Español Deutsch 日本語 TRUMP APPROVAL RATING Better than Obama and Reagan at Same Point in their Presidencies by Jim Hoft Aug. 1, 2018 7:47 pm Jun. 9, 2018 8:46 am Truth Tweet Share Gettr Gab Telegram LinkedIn Free Republic Comments SMS Email According to the latest FOX News poll President Donald Trump has a better rating than Presidents Obama and Reagan at the same point in their presidencies. President Trump’s approval is now at 45% . And that is with 90% negative coverage from the far left mainstream media. President Trump – 45% President Obama – 44% President Reagan – 44% On June 9, 2010 Barack Obama’s approval number was 46% on the Rasmussen poll. President Trump’s approval number is at 47% according to Rasmussen today. Again.... That is with 90% extremely negative coverage for President Trump! Jim Hoft Jim Hoft is the founder and editor of The Gateway Pundit, one of the top conservative news outlets in America. Jim was awarded the Reed Irvine Accuracy in Media Award in 2013 and is the proud recipient of the Breitbart Award for Excellence in Online Journalism from the Americans for Prosperity Foundation in May 2016. In 2023, The Gateway Pundit received the Most Trusted Print Media Award at the A