Politifact:politifact1924,"VIDEO: Special Preview Of Jersey Shore In Miami! Sign up for your daily dose of dope. × or Sign in with lockrMail LOG IN LOG IN NEWS REALITY TV POLITICS TRUE CRIME ROYALS VIDEOS SPORTS RECOMMENDED Home > Reality Tv > Sammi Giancola VIDEO: Special Preview Of Jersey Shore In Miami! Radar Staff June 7 2010, Published 9:30 a.m. ET They're baaaaaackkk!!! A preview of the second season of the breakout hit Jersey Shore aired prior to the MTV Movie Awards on Sunday night. Watch the video on RadarOnline.com In the clip, we get to see the cast migrating south like a flock of tanned, juiced-up birds, as it's explained how the snowy weather in the Northeast this past February brought a halt to the antics the show is based on, hence the change of scenery. Article continues below advertisement Said Pauly D : ""We love Jersey, but you can't tan in this weather, you can't creep in this weather. I think the beaches in Miami Beach are topless -- so I'm gonna be spendin' a lot of time on the beach."" In the clip, Snooki introduces us to her new “gorilla juicehead"" boyfriend Emilio Masella, while offering political analysis on President Barack Obama's tanning tax. HOTOS: Snooki Works In Miami ""I don't go tanning-tanning anymore because Obama put a 10 percent tax on tanning,"" Snooki complained as Masella shot her with spray tan. ""He did that because of us."" MOST READ STORIES TODAY 'Real Housewives of Beverly Hills' and 'Botched' Plastic Surgeon Targeted in Heist by Fake Construction Worker 'Survivor' Star, 41, 'Wanted by FBI' After Vanishing With Son, 16 — Ex-Husband Was Granted Sole Custody Following Nasty Divorce Joy-Anna and Jinger Duggar 'Sickened' by Family's String of Scandals as Sisters Speak Out on 'Horrible Things' EXCLUSIVE: Kim Kardashian Buys Watch Linked to Kennedy Family Tragedy The new season of Jersey Shore , featuring the cast in both South Florida and New Jersey, premieres on MTV Thursday, July 29 at 10/9c. Never Miss an Daily updates from the heart of Hollywood, right to your inbox By entering your email and clicking Sign Up, you’re agreeing to let us send you customized marketing messages about us and our advertising partners. You are also agreeing to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy. READ MORE ON REALITY TV Kylie Jenner 'Wants Bigger Implants' as Boyfriend Timothée Chalamet Is 'Thrilled' by Reality Star's Plastic Surgery Plans Kim Kardashian Reveals Shocking Number of Nannies She Employs to Look After Her Four Kids Got a story for News Team? Email us at tips@radaronline.com GET IN TOUCH FILED UNDER Sammi Giancola Nicole Polizzi Mike Sorrentino Snooki Jersey Shore Breaking News Pauly D Ronnie Magro Jenni Farley hollywood happenings MTV The Situation Vinny Guadagnino Read Next ‘She Plowed Through A Stop Sign Without Stopping On A Dark, Backwoo... More from RadarOnline Jersey Shore Arrives at MTV Movie Awards Jersey Shore Cast Shoots Enrique Iglesias Music Video in Miami History Of Best And Worst Outfits At MTV Movie Awards Advertisement Advertisement It's Over: Jennifer Lopez ‘Isn’t Wasting Time’ Moving on From Ben Affleck as $550 Million Divorce Looms Gossip It's all over all right. On May 14, just one day before news broke that Ben Affleck and Jennifer Lopez are allegedly headed toward a divorce, the singer was spotted house-hunting on her own in Beverly Hills, RadarOnline.com revealed. BY Aaron Johnson Rare Look at 94-Year-Old Clint Eastwood: One-Time Clean-Shaven Movie Icon Changes Faces to Hairy, Grungy Look in Old Age Celebrity Clint Eastwood has hit his “frankly, I don’t give a damn” moment in life! BY Radar Staff Tom Cruise Splashes Fortune on Chopper Rides for New Actress Gal Pal: ‘He Loves Her Bravery in Face of Disability Celebrity Tom Cruise is living up to his Top Gun image by splashing a fortune choppering his new female “best pal” around Britain – after he “fell in love” with the way she's overcome her disability. BY Aaron Tinney More From Radar Online News Investigations Video Exclusives Politics Entertainment Reality TV True Crime Sports Royals About Us Editor's Notes Newsletter Contact Us News Tips Media Advertising YouTube Flipboard News Break Privacy Policy Terms of Use DMCA Policy Cookie Policy Opt-out of personalized ads Manage Privacy Options Manage Privacy Options © Copyright 2026 RADAR ONLINETM️. A DIVISION OF MYSTIFY ENTERTAINMENT NETWORK INC. RADAR ONLINE is a registered trademark. All rights reserved. Registration on or use of this site constitutes acceptance of our Terms of Service, Privacy Policy and Cookies Policy. People may receive compensation for some links to products and services. Offers may be subject to change without notice.",0,Politifact,train
