ciation Represent.us Reps. Keith Rothfus, Mike Kelly and Bill Shuster Republican Governors Association Republican Jewish Coalition Republican National Committee Republican News Republican Party of Florida Republican Party of Georgia Republican Party of Pennsylvania Republican Party of Texas Republican Party of Virginia Republican Party of Wisconsin Republican presidents Republican state Assembly candidates in Wisconsin Republican State Leadership Committee Republican state senators Resistance Report Restoration of America Restoration PAC Restore American Freedom and Liberty Restore Our Future ReverbPress Revitalize Cobb RevolutionRadio.org Rex Tillerson Reza Aslan Rhode Island ACLU Rhode Island Center for Freedom and Prosperity Rhode Island Retirement Security Coalition Rhode Island Senate Rhode Island Tea Party Rhue Reis Ricardo Lara <option value=""rich-golick",0,Politifact,train
