Politifact:politifact13570,"Secret Service Agent Says Obama Is Muslim & Gay In New Tell-All Book - News Examiner - Examine Your World 374 captures 14 Feb 2015 - 11 May 2026 Jan FEB Mar 14 2014 2015 2016 success fail About this capture TIMESTAMPS The Wayback Machine - https://web.archive.org/web/20150214123436/http://newsexaminer.net:80/entertainment/secret-service-agent-says-obama-is-gay-muslim/ Entertainment Tech Art Business Politics News Examiner Facebook Page News Examiner Twitter Page Examine Your World Entertainment Movies Television Music Books Humor Satire Paul Horner News Fappy The Dolphin Cartoons Standup Comedy Advice Horoscopes Opinion Investigative Tech Gaming Science Art Painting Photography Graffiti Food Cooking Recipes Lifestyle Health Fitness Relationships Education Travel Environment Sports Football Baseball Jack Horner – Broadcasting Hall of Fame NBA Fantasy Business Law Local Law Intellectual Property Crime Religion Christianity Atheism Spirituality Politics BREAKING NEWS World Books • Entertainment • Politics Secret Service Agent Says Obama Is Muslim & Gay In New Tell-All Book 2 days ago by Michael Davies 8 Comments Paul Horner Michael Davies A book by a former Secret Service agent claims Barack Obama is a gay Muslim. (AP Photo/Dennis System, File) / AP Washington, DC — A former Secret Service agent whose new book is quickly climbing Amazon’s best-seller charts , said he is concerned about the state of the country and says it is time the public knows the real truth about our Commander in Chief, Barack Obama. Former agent, Paul Horner, in his new tell-all book “The Black House,” reveals what goes on inside the White House when the news cameras are turned off. In an interview with CNN , Horner told Victor Berman that he is one-hundred-percent positive that President Obama is not only gay, but a radical Muslim as well. “Everyone on the inside knows that Obama is gay and a Muslim, it is common knowledge,” Horner said. “I saw many men coming and going from Obama’s room, at all hours. I would say a good portion of the men, over fifty-percent, were Muslim.” Berman: “In your book you talk about several rituals Obama preformed to unwind from his busy schedule. Can you elaborate on these for our viewers?” Horner: “When no one was around, except his security, Obama couldn’t wait to get out of his suit and into his Muslim tunic. He would wear it while praying to the prophet Muhammad throughout the day. During these prayer sessions he insisted that he not be disturbed.” Berman: “Your book spends a whole chapter devoted to the various “tortures” that Obama and the First Lady would subject you to. Can you explain?” Horner: “Because I was white, Obama would force me to listen to Diana Ross full volume, every day, at all hours of the night. It was horrible, I never got any sleep. This is one of the main reasons I finally had to quit.” Berman: “Can you give us any insight on Obama’s feelings towards the American people?” Horner: “He constantly made jokes about Americans, frequently referring to them as “mongoloids” and “idiots”. Christians were his favorite verbal punching bags. He has absolutely no respect for the Christian religion. I believe he actually hates Christians, and finds their ideology to be old fashioned and ignorant.” Berman: What is one of the things readers will find the most shocking? Horner: “Probably the sheer amount of men he welcomed into his bed quarters. I am in no way homophobic, but Obama’s insatiable lust for homosexual liaisons is like nothing I’ve ever witnessed. We’re talking 10-15 partners in a single day.” To read more, pick up a copy of Horner’s book, The Black House , now available on Amazon and at your local bookstore . VIDEO: Secret Service Agent Says Obama Is Muslim & Gay In New Tell-All Book Amazon’s best-seller charts Book Diana Ross Muhammad Obama Obama is gay Obama is Muslim Paul Horner paul horner wrote the Black House Secret service tell-all book The Black House The Black House book The Black House by Paul Horner The Black House secret service agent book Pier 1’s Race to Build Online Business Takes a Toll Colleges classify rape as “personal injury” to hide number of assaults on campus You may also like Entertainment • Movies • Music Kanye West To Spend $500 Million On Awards Show To... Entertainment • Music • Opinion Beyoncé Is Amazing! I Cannot Name One Of Her Songs... Entertainment • Movies • World German Home Entertainment Revenue Slips in 2014 Health • Politics FDA fails to report fraud in clinical trials – study Entertainment • Lifestyle • Television Bruce Jenner Full Steam Ahead On Sex Change Docuseries Business • International • National • Politics Dollar Dump: Egypt to join Russia-led Eurasian free... About the author Michael Davies Reporting on all things fun and exciting! Michael Davies has won many awards including a Peabody and Pulitzer Prize, but says his proudest achievement in life is his 8-year-old girl name Heather. View all posts 8 Comments D. System says: February 10, 2015 at 9:11 pm I bought this book the other day, just fantastic! Couldn’t put it down. It really says a lot, that we already knew, about this current administration Reply Becky L. says: February 10, 2015 at 9:11 pm It’s a little pricey on Amazon, any other place to buy this? Reply Willliam R. says: February 11, 2015 at 5:35 am The way you ex-secrecret service agent describes Obama and the Whitehouse... you feel like you’re almost there Reply Ronald Wilkens says: February 11, 2015 at 5:36 am Fuck Obama, that gay muslim nigger! Reply Dan Wilson says: February 12, 2015 at 10:15 am How much more proof do we need before we can impeach this nigger?!! Reply Sandra D. says: February 12, 2015 at 10:16 am Waiting for my friend to finish up this book so I can read it Reply Barb Lawkins says: February 12, 2015 at 11:09 am Just ordered my copy yesterday, hopefully it will come today Reply Donald R. says: February 12, 2015 at 11:10 am IMPEACH OBAMA!!!!!! Reply Leave a Comment X Name * Email * Website Comment Notify me of follow-up comments by email. Notify me of new posts by email. Featured Posts 94-Year-Old Grandma Kills ‘Knockout Game’ Thug Recent Posts 94-Year-Old Grandma Kills ‘Knockout Game’ Thug Kanye West To Spend $500 Million On Awards Show To Compete With Upcoming Oscars Beyoncé Is Amazing! I Cannot Name One Of Her Songs, But She Deserves Everything She Has Achieved Do You Know You Are Stupid If You Are Stupid? Colleges classify rape as “personal injury” to hide number of assaults on campus Recent Comments Mike C. on Kanye West To Spend $500 Million On Awards Show To Compete With Upcoming Oscars Ronald Jenkins on Kanye West To Spend $500 Million On Awards Show To Compete With Upcoming Oscars Laura Davies on Kanye West To Spend $500 Million On Awards Show To Compete With Upcoming Oscars Paul Bonerville on Kanye West To Spend $500 Million On Awards Show To Compete With Upcoming Oscars Categories Select Category Advice Art Atheism Baseball Bill Murray Books BREAKING NEWS Business Christianity Cooking Crime Democratic Education Entertainment Environment Fantasy Fappy The Dolphin Fitness Food Football Gaming Graffiti Health Hockey Horoscopes Humor Intellectual Property International Investigative Jack Horner – Broadcasting Hall of Fame Law Lifestyle Local Law Movies Music National NBA Opinion Painting Paul Horner News Photography Politics Recipes Religion Republican Satire Science Skateboarding Spirituality Sports Standup Comedy Tea Party Tech Television The WAR on Christmas Travel World World Records G+ Google+ Most Popular 94-Year-Old Grandma Kills ‘Knockout Game’ Thug Kanye West To Spend $500 Million On Awards Show To... Beyoncé Is Amazing! I Cannot Name One Of Her Songs... Do You Know You Are Stupid If You Are Stupid? Talked About Kanye West To Spend $500 Million On Awards Show To Compete With Upcoming Oscars Beyoncé Is Amazing! I Cannot Name One Of Her Songs, But She Deserves Everything She Has Achieved Secret Service Agent 