ther collecting huge speaking fees for destroying the country. 2k SHARES SHARE ON FACEBOOK SHARE ON TWITTER Related About The Potatriot 115 Articles The Potatriot is a Constitutional Conservative from the Constitutional Republic of the United States. Previous BREAKING: Chelsea’s Childhood Friend Just Blew The Lid Off MURDEROUS Clinton Family Secrets Next Trump Forced To Take Drastic Action After Trey Gowdy’s Murderer Got Away Search for: America – Love It Or Leave It! America – Love It Or Leave It! Hottest Stories: BREAKING NEWS: Sarah Palin In A Coma After Hit And Run... It seems as though there may be more than the normal forces at play here. 9.1k Shares BREAKING: Monica Lewinsky Found Dead In Roslindale... Why isn't this all over the news? 7k Shares MAJOR Announcement From SCOTUS: Trump Is Going To Get Another Supreme ... Get your buckets out. It's time to collect the liberal tears. 5.8k Shares The FBI Found Bill Clinton’s Kill Room During Chappaqua Raid... The Clinton house of cards is coming down. 5.5k Shares Clinton Estate Is Officially A Crime Scene As 11 More ‘Steel Bar... There's a 2-mile perimeter around the house and investigators want to expand that. 5.5k Shares BREAKING: Barrels Removed From Clinton Property Contained Parts From 3... Just how the hell is he supposed to explain this? 5.1k Shares UPDATE: Sarah Palin Out Of Her Coma, Able To Identify Her Attackers... Sarah Palin is way too strong a woman to let something like this get the best of her. 3.9k Shares A Drunken Alec Baldwin Just Got Knocked Out On The Streets Of New York... Hey Alec, this is what happens when a REAL American gets a hold of a liberal sissy like you! 3.6k Shares BREAKING: Supreme Court Reverses Major Ruling, Thousands Of Liberals B... GREAT news! 3k Shares BREAKING NEWS: George Soros Indicted For Voter Machine Fraud And More... It's about time. 2.7k Shares ABOUT FREEDOM CROSSROADS We believe that there is nothing more precious than the mind of an aging conservative. Here we gathe